mbox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .ambox{display:none!important}}</style><table class="box-Refimprove plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content" role="presentation"><tbody><tr><td class="mbox-image"><div style="width:52px"><span typeof="mw:File"><a href="/wiki/File:Tango-nosources.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/60px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="45" height="45" class="mw-file-element" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/120px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="48" data-file-height="48" /></a></span></div></td><td class="mbox-text"><div class="mbox-text-span">此條目<b>需要補充更多<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:列明來源">來源</a></b>。<span class="hide-when-compact"></span> <small class="date-container"><i>(<span class="date">2024年7月2日</span>)</i></small><span class="hide-when-compact"><br /><small>請協助補充多方面<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:可靠來源">可靠來源</a>以<a class="external text" data-mw-original-href="//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84&amp;action=edit" href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84&amp;action=edit">改善這篇條目</a>，<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81" class="mw-redirect" title="Wikipedia:可供查證">無法查證</a>的內容可能會因為<a href="/wiki/Template:Fact" class="mw-redirect" title="Template:Fact">異議提出</a>而被移除。<br />致使用者：請搜尋一下條目的標題（來源搜尋：<span class="plainlinks"><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?&amp;as_eq=wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84%22">"社會規範"</a> &#8212; <a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?q=%22%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84%22">網頁</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=&amp;as_src=-newswire+-wire+-presswire+-PR+-press+-release+-wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84%22">新聞</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//books.google.com/books?&amp;as_brr=0&amp;as_pub=-icon&amp;q=%22%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84%22">書籍</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//scholar.google.com/scholar?&amp;q=%22%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84%22">學術</a>、<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="//www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;safe=off&amp;q=%22%E7%A4%BE%E6%9C%83%E8%A6%8F%E7%AF%84%22">圖像</a></span>），以檢查網路上是否存在該主題的更多可靠來源（<a href="/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90" title="Wikipedia:可靠來源">判定指引</a>）。</small></span><span class="hide-when-compact"></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>
